  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="57.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 57.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="57.1" corresp="#wit-d">⁊ we willað, þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> ælc Ro<hi rend="italic">m</hi>pæni beo gelæst be Petres mæssan to ða<hi rend="italic">m</hi> bisceopstole.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-d">And it is our will that every Rome-penny is to be paid to the bishop's see by St Peter's day.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin" corresp="#wit-d">And we ordain that all dues to Rome are to be paid to the episcopal see by St. Peter's day.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wir wollen, dass jeder Rompfennig zu Petri Festtag entrichtet werde an den Bischofsstuhl.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And we will that every Rome-penny be paid by St Peter's day to the bishop's see.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares VIII Atr.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
